orkers-in-latest-cost-cut", "url": "https://t.co/4aVrrV1Dh4"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/xuvvaV5RDC", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lisaabramowicz1/status/2114799699656122738/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114797884432343040", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/xuvvaV5RDC"}]}, "id": "2114799699656122738", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 78, "impression_count": 48834, "like_count": 525, "quote_count": 9, "reply_count": 62, "retweet_count": 117}, "text": "Big Tech has been cutting staff, keeping headcount stable or declining even as business booms. The latest: Microsoft offering buyouts to 60,000 employees. Are tech workers uniquely exposed to AI disruption, or are they an example of what's to come? https://t.co/4aVrrV1Dh4 https://t.co/xuvvaV5RDC", "url": "https://x.com/lisaabramowicz1/status/2114799699656122738"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:12:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114797434673234229"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/michaelmaiello…", "end": 221, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/michaelmaiello/status/2114793446359896222", "start": 198, "url": "https://t.co/gMTiyf0NqN"}]}, "id": "2114797434673234229", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 51, "impression_count": 59169, "like_count": 385, "quote_count": 13, "reply_count": 47, "retweet_count": 19}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114793446359896222", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is the problem with communists, capitalists, and neoliberals. They have no easy way of measuring the value of community on a spreadsheet, so they get around it by assigning it no value at all. https://t.co/gMTiyf0NqN", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2114797434673234229"}, {"author_id": "48463418", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:57:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114793464768401501"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 12, "start": 0, "tag": "APSSummit27"}], "urls": [{"description": "Gain insights from leading experts in your specific areas of interest 